# hypernix.whisk API reference

Implementation: `src/hypernix/models/whisk.py`

## `swa_average(items, strict=False) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]`

Uniform mean across all inputs. ``strict=False`` ignores keys

## `ema(items, decay=0.99, strict=False) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]`

Exponential moving average. Earlier inputs are weighted by

## `geometric_mean(items, strict=False, eps=1e-12) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]`

Element-wise geometric mean. Negative or zero values are

## `whisk(items, mode='swa', decay=0.99, strict=False) -> dict[str, torch.Tensor]`

Pick a whisking mode by name.

## `whisk_to_snapshot(items, out_dir, tokenizer_source=None, mode='swa', decay=0.99, strict=False) -> Path`

Whisk + write a full snapshot directory in one call.
